/-
  The HTTP side of the Worker's DEUS handlers (task 41714c0d): reading a request and making the responses the
  replication API answers with, over `Js` (D237).
-/
/-- A request's method, `GET` or `PUT` and so on. -/
def Worker.Http.method (request : Js) : Text := Js.toText (Js.get request "method")